{"meta":{"id":"tt12532368","type":"movie","name":"Pollonejo y el hámster de la oscuridad","imdb_id":"tt12532368","description":"Cuenta la historia de Hopper, el hijo adoptivo del Rey Pedro, un famoso aventurero que nació mitad pollo y mitad liebre. Ansioso por ser aceptado a pesar de sus diferencias, Hopper se embarca en una emocionante aventura junto con su fiel sirviente Abe, una tortuga sarcástica, y Meg, una mofeta intrépida experta en artes marciales, en busca de la codiciada reliquia conocida como el Hámster de la Oscuridad. Los tres se enfrentan a todo un reto al tener que llegar antes que Lapin, un villano cuya reciente fuga de la cárcel amenaza la paz del reino.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt12532368.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7neeXze9HB3MTxDYyh3wwysydMN.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4Z40oLSs8Krq8mduD6c32oL5bcP.png","genres":["Animación","Aventura","Comedia","Familia","Fantasía"],"releaseInfo":"2022","released":"2022-02-16T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"91 min","imdbRating":"6.3","country":"Belgium, France, United States of America","cast":["Jordan Tartakow","Joe Ochman","Laila Berzins","Danny Fehsenfeld","Chris McCune","Michael Orenstein","Dino Andrade","Kyle Hebert","James Fredrick","Jeff Doucette","Joey Camen","Cedric L. Williams","Marcus Griffin","Donte Paris","Michael Sorich","Brad Venable","Mark Irons"],"director":["Benjamin Mousquet","Ben Stassen"],"writer":["David Collard","Chris Grine"],"trailers":[{"source":"Ggd0Lnn3Qf4","type":"Trailer","name":"Hopper, el polloliebre - Tráiler español","ytId":"Ggd0Lnn3Qf4","lang":"es"},{"source":"0WpES_bo4mE","type":"Trailer","name":"nWave | Chickenhare and the Hamster of Darkness (2022) | Trailer","ytId":"0WpES_bo4mE","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"Ggd0Lnn3Qf4","title":"Hopper, el polloliebre - Tráiler español"},{"ytId":"0WpES_bo4mE","title":"nWave | Chickenhare and the Hamster of Darkne